00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:48.160
walk to help other people out who really

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:50.240
needed someone in their lives. Now,

00:01:48.160 --> 00:01:52.280
after I read about this, I was genuinely

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:54.040
